        "original_id": "08f3c0d6-f6e4-5fd4-b1f7-fd5ca2c1f188",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film)\n- People: Roland Joffé, Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, Robert Duvall, Andrew G. Vajna, Mario Kassar\n- Companies: Cinergi Pictures, C2 Pictures, Carolco Pictures\n- Topics: Gary Oldman career\n\nFacts:\n- Gary Leonard Oldman was born on 21 March 1958 and is an English actor, filmmaker, musician, and author who has worked in theatre, film, and television.\n- The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\n- Roland Joffé directed The Scarlet Letter, and the film stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\n- The Scarlet Letter was one of several box office bombs that contributed to Cinergi Pictures closing in 1998.\n- C2 Pictures was started in 2002 by Carolco Pictures co-founders Andrew G. Vajna and Mario Kassar.\n- Andrew G. Vajna had formed Cinergi Pictures before that company folded in 1998.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
