        "text": "Page: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film). Sentence: The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\nPage: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film). Sentence: It was directed by Roland Joffé and stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\nPage: Gary Oldman. Sentence: Gary Leonard Oldman (born 21 March 1958) is an English actor, filmmaker, musician and author who has performed in theatre, film and television.\nPage: Cinergi Pictures. Sentence: A string of box office bombs - including \"Color of Night\", \"Judge Dredd\", \"The Scarlet Letter\", \"Nixon\", \"Shadow Conspiracy\", \"Deep Rising\" and \"\" - ultimately undid the company, and it closed in 1998.\nPage: C2 Pictures. Sentence: C2 Pictures was a film company started in 2002 by Carolco Pictures co-founders Andrew G. Vajna (who had formed Cinergi Pictures until it folded in 1998) and Mario Kassar.",
